  "summary": "A semester of Grade 8 English: building and evaluating arguments, tracing theme in short fiction, memoir and personal narrative, informational reading and research, poetry, and drama. Six units, each with a student overview, a teacher guide with a five-day plan, a lesson, assignments, an assessment with a rubric and an answer key. Every story, poem, scene and article is original to EducateOS except one public-domain poem by Emily Dickinson.",
